{"version":1,"content":"<p>32歲日本創作男歌手優里，出道多年憑《Dry Flower》一曲走紅樂壇。</p><p>去年曾於西九文化區舉行首次香港演唱會的他，相隔一年再來港，今晚假亞洲博覽館Hall 10舉行第2次港騷，並已於昨日順利入境香港。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T02:43:54.917953+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:19:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:16.402857+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T02:37:16.402857+00:00","content_hash":"fca06917d7b50fd462b28a63710cd596acf35cd9f88ee5fa3276cc8f13bd70d0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}